# VITAMIN Model Checker environment template
#
# The model-checker library does not require environment variables by default.
# Keep this file as a consistent template across VITAMIN modules.
#
# Release tokens: copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill in.
# scripts/release.sh publish reads PYPI_API_TOKEN, publish-test reads TEST_PYPI_API_TOKEN.
# PYPI_API_TOKEN=pypi-...
# TEST_PYPI_API_TOKEN=pypi-...
#
# Optional examples:
# PYTHONPATH=.
# PYTEST_ADDOPTS=-q
